<title>UK: RDM International sets 100 bln lire four-year FRN.</title>
<headline>RDM International sets 100 bln lire four-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Instituto Mobilliare Italiano, Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RDM INTERNATIONAL S.A.</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  RENO DE MEDICI S.P.A.</p>
<p> AMT    100 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    24.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     0.50	PAY DATE    24.MAR.97</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES  0.68	REOFFER     99.50</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 MGT/UND    0.18	SELL CONC   0.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
